00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.660
if you have a civil lawsuit.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:43.890
They have different judges and

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.160
they have completely
different sets of laws

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.400
that they are going to
apply on a daily basis,

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.210
and you can't just show
