It is filled with character evidence,

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:21.290
sometimes you can bring
in someone's character

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.640
for truthfulness, that
is slightly different

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:27.200
than normal character
evidence, but, still,

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.480
that opening statement
is number one, terrible,

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.570
number two, strange because he's wearing

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.750
these giant hands for some
reason, and number three,

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:37.330
this lawyer didn't explain
or provide any facts

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.160
as to why his client is innocent

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.590
of the things that are
being alleged against him.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.540
And I'm not even sure
what's going on here other

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:48.640
than claiming that there was
a loss of the use of one eye.

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.780
But neither of the lawyers
here have done a very good job

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.640
in their opening statements, at all.

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:56.100
Are they ever going to explain
why he's wearing giant hands?

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.170
- I'm gonna stop you right now,

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:01.350
are you just gonna talk
about your hands for awhile?

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:05.960
- No your honor, no more
questions for the witness.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:10.960
- Deandra, here is the statement
that you gave to police.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:13.840
- Okay the order of this
questioning is totally backwards.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.530
The plaintiff bears the
burden, and so they have

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.990
to call their witnesses first,

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:19.810
and then when you call a witness,

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.440
you question that witness first,

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:23.120
you then get a cross examination,

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.810
and then under some circumstances

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.840
you get a redirect
examination of the witness.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.990
It is not at all clear that the plaintiff

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:31.940
has done the first round of questioning.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.701
I think for dramatic effect they switched

00:08:33.701 --> 00:08:35.800
the order of the questioning.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:36.941
- Bill did it, that--

00:08:36.941 --> 00:08:37.774
(bleeping sound)

00:08:37.774 --> 00:08:40.240
drug addict is out of his
mind, I'll testify to that.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.090
I swear on my mother's grave
that Bill spiked that milk,

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:47.560
no doubt about it, he's
guilty, guilty, guilty.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:50.130
- So here, he doesn't
actually get an answer

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:53.850
from the witness, so, there
wasn't actually any testimony

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:56.840
that was elicited not that
there's a jury listening.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.410
But the judge may actually
care what's on the record,

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.010
and what is not on the record,

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:03.650
and all he's done here is ask a question

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:06.070
and elicited no response from the witness,

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:08.670
and therefore he hasn't
gotten any evidence

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:11.070
that will help him in this trial.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.600
Now, this document may also be hearsay,

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:16.180
it sounds like it might've been
a sworn statement to police.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.830
So under some circumstances,
it might not be hearsay.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:21.450
Remember, that hearsay is
an out of court statement,

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:24.270
used to prove the truth
of the matter asserted.

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:26.560
Here he is definitely
using it for the truth

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.780
of the matter asserted that Bill Ponderosa

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:32.080
is guilty or liable for
whatever he's being accused of.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.060
But, the main problem here
is that he hasn't gotten

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:36.340
an answer from the witness,

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.980
and he hasn't entered this
document into evidence.

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:42.360
So, there's no evidence
to talk about right now.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.980
- I'm sorry, what did you say?

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.040
- He spiked it, and then
